<h1>30 Days English Speaking</h1>
<p><b>Author:</b> Kaizen Books</p>
<p>Daily 10 minutes practice tho basic English improve chesukovadaniki ee eBook.</p>

<h2>Day 1</h2>
<div class="day">
  <p><b>Hello</b> = Namaste</p>
  <p><b>How are you?</b> = Ela unnaru?</p>
  <p><b>I am fine.</b> = Nenu bagunnanu.</p>
</div>

<h2>Day 2</h2>
<div class="day">
  <p><b>What is your name?</b> = Mee peru enti?</p>
  <p><b>My name is Raju.</b> = Na peru Raju.</p>
</div>

<h2>Day 3</h2>
<div class="day">
  <p><b>Where are you from?</b> = Meeru ekkada nunchi vacharu?</p>
  <p><b>I am from Andhra Pradesh.</b></p>
</div>

<h2>Day 4</h2>
<div class="day">
  <p><b>Thank you.</b> = Dhanyavadalu.</p>
  <p><b>Please.</b> = Dayachesi.</p>
</div>

<h2>Day 5</h2>
<div class="day">
  <p><b>Good Morning</b></p>
  <p><b>Good Night</b></p>
</div>

<p>... Day 6 nunchi Day 30 varaku ilage continue cheyyachu.</p>

